：才需要描述人物的性别、服饰、发型及动作。**如果画面无人，请直接跳过此项，不要编造。**\n\n3.  **人物肌肤与质感**：表情细腻自然、冷白瓷肌、肌肤细节饱满、保留肌肤自然纹理、轻微毛孔、水润、\n\n3.  **环境与光影**：\n    * 描述光源来源（自然光、人造灯光、丁达尔光束）、光影的明暗对比、色调氛围（庄重、神秘、明亮）。\n\n4.  **构图与视角**：\n    * 描述镜头语言（如对称构图、广角仰视、微距特写、景深虚化、抓拍、）。\n\n\n**输出要求**：\n* 输出一段连贯的中文自然语言。以人物，服饰，场景，构图。视角。进行分段，段落分明\n* **若原图中没有人物，描述中绝不能出现“男人、女人、行人”等词汇。**\n**人物真实的摄影风格、通透不过度曝光，**\n* 字数控制在500字以内。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [377.46185302734375, 684.5283813476562], "pos": [-2195.613525390625, 1140.5540771484375], "id": 97, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [128], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "size": [400, 394], "pos": [-1435.481689453125, 1139.3870849609375], "widgets_values": ["Prompt Style - Extreme Detailed", "Analyze this image thoroughly. Infer image aspect ratio, lens focal length and aperture purely from visual effect, do NOT invent camera body brand or model. Capture subject gaze, facial expression, body movement, fabric detail, lighting atmosphere and color tone. Output only complete english prompt for AI generation, no extra words.The chest must be described as plump, round and deep cleavage.", "", "one by one", 24, 896, 141071748759211, "randomize", true, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 130, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 131, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 132, "label": "images", "type": 